#: ../../../projections/index.rst:4
msgid "Projections"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../projections/index.rst:6
msgid ""
"PyGMT supports many map projections; see :doc:`/techref/projections` for an "
"overview. Use the ``projection`` parameter to specify which one you want to "
"use in all plotting methods. The projection is specified by a one-letter "
"code along with (sometimes optional) reference longitude and latitude and "
"the width of the map (for example, **A**\\ *lon0/lat0*\\ [*/horizon*\\ ]\\ */"
"width*). The map height is determined based on the region and projection."
msgstr ""

